# Nested match with TypeAssert patterns in both levels.
# Demonstrates TypeAssert patterns work in nested match expressions.
[
  outer: [1 "hello" 3.14]
  result: [match [get 1 outer]
    [@String s]: [match [get 0 outer]
      [@Int i]: [str i " and " s]
      _: "no-int"]
    _: "no-string"]
]
=== out
Dict({"outer": Dict({0: Int(1), 1: String("hello"), 2: Float(3.14)}), "result": String("1 and hello")})

=== warn
[UnificationFailure] cannot unify Int with String
[UnificationFailure] cannot unify Int with String
